  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Matrices and Transformations: describing a stretch</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 2.1: Identify the invariant axis and stretch factor of a one-way stretch from a triangle and its image, and give its matrix.</p><p id="edition">Core</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
